  "description": "An umbrella term for non-heterosexual and non-cisgender identities. The drag performer in the image is a symbol of queer identity and expression. The meme’s message about acceptance and self-acceptance is deeply rooted in the experiences of queer individuals who often navigate the tension between societal norms and their authentic selves.",
